      "id": "claim_5be93eb0cbd24069868ef43a6e9d7757",
      "statement": "The release PR body and the GitHub Release body come from the CHANGELOG: release.yml tags a merged commit and dist autodetects CHANGELOG.md, using the '## [<version>]' section as the GitHub Release body; cliff.toml excludes 'chore' commits (mostly Renovate bumps) from the generated sections.",
