    {
      "id": "claim_311c8e7d3899420d9b98825ab1cf3b6b",
      "statement": "release.yml's custom-homebrew-app-token job publishes cargo-dist Homebrew formulae to the micschr0/homebrew-tap tap: stable releases land in claudebar.rb, while prereleases are renamed to claudebar@beta.rb with the bottle block stripped; it refuses to clobber a half-downloaded formula and fails on class/filename drift so a broken formula never reaches users.",
