    {
      "id": "claim_b6d8281214c647968b0ef7bf6cc29f43",
      "statement": "verify-install.yml triggers on release: published and end-to-end-tests install.sh against the published release assets in a clean HOME across a matrix of Linux-musl and macOS targets; it strips cargo/.cargo/bin from PATH to force the Tier 1 prebuilt download (so a broken prebuilt can't be masked by falling back to cargo build) and exercises both the piped-stdin curl|bash path and the sourced path, verifying the installed binary is executable, reports --version, and renders.",
